              "literal": "    (∀ y xRef : E, ∀ z₀ : E × E, ∀ e : ℕ → ℝ≥0, ∀ n : ℕ,\n      ∀ a : ℝ≥0 × (E × E), record y xRef z₀ e n = Sum.inl a →\n        (e n = 0 → record y xRef z₀ e (n + 1) = Sum.inl (a.1, S xRef a.2)) ∧\n        (∀ b : ℝ≥0 × (E × E), 0 < e n →\n          record y xRef z₀ e (n + 1) = Sum.inl b → a.1 < b.1))",
              "title": "Zero threshold and conditional strict growth"
            }
          ],
          "counts": {
            "callers": 6,
